教」有效，必须先按风格给学生分组，再把每组学生随机分配到不同教法。最后要用同一份测验考。有效的判据是出现一种特定的交互作用：对一种风格最有效的教法，对另一种风格不是最有效的。综述的结论是：几乎没有发现这种交互作用。关于学习风格的文献虽然很多，但用了合格实验设计的研究极少，其中几项的结果还直接和「匹配假说」相反。作者据此认为，现有证据不足以支持把学习风格测评用进教育实践。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Pashler H, McDaniel M, Rohrer D, Bjork R (2008). Learning Styles: Concepts and Evidence. Psychological Science in the Public Interest, 9(3), 105–119. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1539-6053.2009.01038.x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1539-6053.2009.01038.x"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["综述同时说明，这不等于所有版本的学习风格理论都被测过并被否定，很多根本没被测过。要避免的是花钱做风格测评、按风格挑培训班这两件事。挑培训的标准见第 9 条（培训优先走政府补贴渠道）和第 13 条（优先选能直接上岗的短周期项目）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/23-17"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"几种题型混着练，别一种连做二十道"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/23-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"要背的内容按将来的用法出题考自己，别原样背一遍就算完"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/23-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["学完先合上书自己考一遍，别回头重读"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["比起读完再读一遍，合上书考自己一遍效果更好。课堂上加了小测验，成绩提高属于中等幅度。给十种常用学法排名时，自测排在最高一档。读完一节先默写要点，再翻回去对。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/23-15"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把同样的时间摊到几天，别一次学完"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["同样的时间，分几天学比一次学完记得牢。还有一条实用规律：你要记到多久以后，复习间隔就该拉多长。考得越远，间隔越长，但具体隔几天，研究没给通用的数。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/23-16"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别把划重点、反复读、写摘要当成主要学法"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["学生最常用的是划重点和反复读，可在十种常用学法的排名里，这两样都在最低一档。写摘要、关键词记忆法、给课文配图想象也在最低一档。它们不是完全没用，只是起作用的条件…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/23-20"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["评职称先弄清自己在哪个系列、哪一级，再按单位性质找申报渠道"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["职称全国分 27 个系列，每个系列分初级、中级、高级。一般要一级一级往上报。在单位上班的，由单位审核、公示后往上报。在民营企业的，可以去职称申报受理服务点，或者…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/23-21"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["会计这类初级、中级职称靠全国统考拿，先对照学历和工作年限去报名"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["有些系列的初级、中级职称是考出来的，考过就算，不再另外评审。会计就是这样：助理会计师要高中以上学历，会计师要本科干满 4 年会计、大专满 5 年。已经拿到某些职…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/23-22"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别找中介代评、别买论文代写、别在材料上造假：查实就撤销职称，记诚信档案 3 年"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["用假材料、代写论文、剽窃成果拿到的职称，查实就撤销。失信记录要记 3 年，还进全国信用平台。申报时签的承诺书不实，3 年内不能再申报。人社部门还专门查处中介的虚…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/23"},"children":["阅读整个主题：学什么技能划算 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0